{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "a08ea2f2dd22aec6ffc4b187842312e376e0055d84eb5f5a5a2e9e35b8f7cb02", "ja": "セクシーの香り", "zh": "性感的芳香", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a9d55709cf024cfda731f8b5b9b1745b55b4836c23f74ee56d9befde43f70be0", "ja": "再び現れた黒井社長から単独でスカウトされ\nる莉緒。その後どこか様子がおかしい。\nそんな莉緒から不吉な匂いを感じ取る可憐。\nそしてプロデューサーは莉緒と直接話すこと\nに……。", "zh": "再度现身的黑井社长打算挖角莉绪一个人，\n在那之后，莉绪的模样一直有些怪异。\n可怜在这样的莉绪身上嗅出了不祥的气味，\n因此制作人决定亲自找莉绪谈一谈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1000_046rio", "source_sha256": "c3135dc19eb07619a383429ce920555ce34a53b5a22c11eef8c419bb964ad769", "ja": "うーん、レッスンの時間まで、だいぶあるわね……。\nちょっと早く来すぎちゃったかしら？", "zh": "嗯……训练课程还要一段时间才开始……\n我是不是来得太早了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "c07bf24b1e2e7e797691be89914f760944f31cf1600a70b93fcd621dd26b6f07", "ja": "せっかくだし、寄り道しちゃおうかな？\n新しいスカートがほしかったのよね、ウフッ♪", "zh": "机会难得，去附近绕绕好了。\n我正想买件新裙子呢，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1002_kuroi", "source_sha256": "1d9f4aebefaa698cd63ac8a09c4233bb87e9086ea82ddd49958a51bfb4b2543e", "ja": "ククク、集合時間前に来るとは、\nなかなか勤勉のようだね？　……百瀬莉緒くん。", "zh": "哼哼哼，在集合时间前抵达，\n还真是勤奋呢……百濑莉绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "021ac64259e387f9a4b1e31948f58eda6f1d5439f08093aaf2128d82ec4b8959", "ja": "く、黒井社長！？\n……わざわざ待ち伏せまでして、何の用？", "zh": "黑、黑井社长！？\n……你特地埋伏在这里等我，是有什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1004_kuroi", "source_sha256": "f1a36ff004646b7349cd485e1075a305478e14c1e950f98b666a2128dfb928a3", "ja": "すでに伝えている通りだよ？\n君をウチの事務所に迎えたいのだ。", "zh": "我已经说过了吧？\n我想让你到我们事务所来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1005_kuroi", "source_sha256": "902a1f66e04840175fb67e46521205c84e75f97b494fa5392b91cf8540234afa", "ja": "島原エレナくんには断られてしまったが……。それは\n彼女が、冷静な判断をくだせぬお子様というだけの事。", "zh": "虽然岛原艾琳娜拒绝了……\n那是因为她是无法冷静判断是非的小孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "3c6bccccf70f1e0d70230284b7a30d82f1d28b56c4d0ca9b57b1983b65122a9d", "ja": "ちょっと。エレナちゃんにフラれたからって、\nそんな言い方はないんじゃない？", "zh": "等等，就算你被艾琳娜拒绝了，\n也不该说这种话吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1007_kuroi", "source_sha256": "d91cea4f4fd7c2d0d741eb9455c02c88ff4177aa94c1b2644f1e2c1116a5cb3e", "ja": "別に彼女に固執しているワケではない。何故なら、\n私が本当にスカウトしたいのは……君なのだから。", "zh": "我并没有特别执着于她。那是因为，\n我真正想挖角的对象……是你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "be3c50d3096f86bddc8c748ac04e6fd31e70f4cdfe46d3617e4afd161cf7448d", "ja": "…………え？", "zh": "…………咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1009_kuroi", "source_sha256": "3ab11dcd72c45d5c9b4cf1876e8e57fd93388f9198d4a92d17b04e5b92e45f2d", "ja": "エレナくんはたまたま君とコンビを組んでいたから、\n一緒に声をかけたまで……オマケに過ぎんのだよ。", "zh": "只不过是因为艾琳娜碰巧和你在同一组，\n我才向你们两个搭话……不过就是附带的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1010_kuroi", "source_sha256": "fb1dcc765cab032360dbdebc090314738c3b5c336449dbb052017a765a9fb241", "ja": "961プロには、君こそが必要なのだ！\n君がその目をさまし、ウチに移籍した暁には……。", "zh": "961艺能真正需要的是你！\n在你想通，跳槽到我们事务所的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1011_kuroi", "source_sha256": "82d539f25644c8f8360d3be0e2512aa9b398575ca2e2850e9cde37b113287498", "ja": "そうだな。デビューと同時に、書店に並ぶすべての\n週刊誌のグラビアを、君で埋め尽くすと約束しよう！", "zh": "这样好了。我答应你，会在你出道的同时，\n让书店陈列的每一本周刊杂志都登出你的写真照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "d2f5b025c7a99a6a12e545fd40619b0484143b4a9fbc4dbc6bfb4385357231e5", "ja": "す、すべてのグラビアを……！？", "zh": "所、所有杂志……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "6b68631220b116bd871ea24cccb80ae74253aaade08d147b8bc36109dbbabf26", "ja": "う、ウソよ！\nそそ、そんなコト、できるわけないでしょ！", "zh": "骗、骗人！\n这这、这怎么可能办得到呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1014_kuroi", "source_sha256": "68b3bfceba35c647804fb899659fa0be2e4dbffd86bf2c11e9722f362e84641d", "ja": "765プロのような、アリンコプロでは無理だろうな。\nだが、我が961プロにとっては造作もないのだよ！", "zh": "在765艺能这种蝼蚁般的事务所大概不可能吧。\n但对我们961艺能而言，可是轻而易举呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1015_kuroi", "source_sha256": "81742bc6728fdb077a83ba90933b6c47885d43903306ec463ba98bec377718b1", "ja": "さあ、どうかね？　全国の男子高校生達の、\n憧れのお姉さんになってみる気はないかね？", "zh": "怎么样？你想不想当全国高中男生\n都爱慕的大姊姊呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "d67df5b9e32ffb2f2fa059a9811243fc37c9ef609acdee22c84621ad54932cb2", "ja": "ぜ、全国の……男子高校生達……！？\n私が……憧れの、お姉さん……！", "zh": "全、全国……高中男生……！？\n我变成……他们爱慕的大姊姊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1017_null", "source_sha256": "5dfa484cd64674d268ed8f36257070f18bb5c255be27f79990897492e7acb03b", "ja": "午後……", "zh": "下午……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "470e2ec21ca35629657b9dff8a1caa3a7d54e13ea4ccc50b3c3f729c1ae73541", "ja": "（今日はARRIVEのメンバー全員でレッスンだ。\n思った以上に、みんなできているな。あとは……）", "zh": "（今天是『ARRIVE』全体成员的训练课程，\n大家的熟练程度都超乎想像呢，只剩下……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "5161409468cd16dfe9032affbb58ffd1353c08bb50d365f804c5b4b9ade66b81", "ja": "ワン・ツー・スリー・フォー、\nクルッとターンの……決めポーズ！", "zh": "1、2、3、4，\n转一圈之后……招牌姿势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "6e1b132941420af4fd9a347efbfcc3707444e6274e3752dee1d6048ddc395b0a", "ja": "うん！　バッチリだヨー！\nこの調子で、もう1回……あれれ？", "zh": "嗯！很完美唷──！\n就这样再来一次……咦咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "96997920ab56cd0a43738b65b61fbe5fa4d38cd429216162a9aaa34888037ea8", "ja": "はあ……はあ……申し訳ありません、島原エレナ。\n今日は……ここまでに……させてください……。", "zh": "呼……呼……实在非常抱歉，岛原艾琳娜。\n今天……就请练到……这里为止吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "60e7bc678ea01720f3ac90d25aaa1beaf45fcb7a945d7483a32c03ac0a36a33a", "ja": "えー。早すぎるヨー？\nもっと元気に行こっ♪", "zh": "咦～太快了啦～\n打起精神再加把劲吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "2528644570eb8ed76e7cd918d6aec6ffb1333b7ab5be6ae05fd387a424ad4ad5", "ja": "ひぃ……はぁ……。\nロコも、ぎ、ギブアップです～……。", "zh": "咿……哈……\nROCO也Gi……Give up……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "68558787284c5bece3f16b02d0b87d73f697d71e902a0edb748aeafc9e6fc132", "ja": "はあ、はあ……さすが、エレナさん……。\n息ひとつ、乱れてなくて……すごいです……。", "zh": "呼、呼……不愧是艾琳娜……\n连喘都不会喘……真厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "3f4bcd0c89a66e38b7449eda020736966249e96d4c77e3741984234404140db8", "ja": "（やっぱり、エレナの体力はケタ外れだな！\nこういう時は、だいたい莉緒が張り合って……）", "zh": "（艾琳娜的体力果然超乎寻常呢！\n这时候通常是莉绪会和她争个高下……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "e79a316c538b61f8abd34b9398c09f6a03f13c0618545545a72cc7bb4e3bb410", "ja": "ンー……。\nあっ、リオは？　リオなら行けるよネっ♪", "zh": "嗯……\n啊，那莉绪呢？莉绪应该还行吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1027_046rio", "source_sha256": "5c39a288e16a1a8b880740cfb76a9010957a97e9226521fabde50dc659e24888", "ja": "ん？　ああ……私も、ちょっと疲れちゃったかも。\n今日は、ここまでにしましょ。", "zh": "嗯？啊……我好像也有点累了耶，\n今天就练到这里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "188986b7dd6950f79e1db4001a9a902b4dcd0f851b28eaba394080a7b024e999", "ja": "あ、あれ？　リオも疲れちゃったノ……？\nそっか……。", "zh": "奇、奇怪？莉绪也累了吗……？\n这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "55c412e2f63c7312be36cbedc9c2a4b95261dcc743f03403fb2651feba9f21e7", "ja": "（ん？　珍しいな……）", "zh": "（嗯？还真难得……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "cdc7f2e26ca3e2a7a45810665871390e526ee73a0871461d6ef7ebb77f512a13", "ja": "なに？　{$P$}くん。", "zh": "怎么了？{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "68413581afa59b0883b6d7cd47f5bf1cbae85b417bb7d7c9ae8cb49078e693f3", "ja": "いや……。", "zh": "没事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "8621e3c2a1f933144f7adf159a109e330b385c135980b473bfeef27139b12fa7", "ja": "（いつもなら、自分からエレナと張り合いにいくのに。\nもしかして、具合でも……）", "zh": "（她平常明明都会主动和艾琳娜较劲的，\n该不会是身体状况……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1033_p", "source_sha256": "2da0b674cd816be803f51e0cb3047149a83caa96147c739f63a38f9ab34d623b", "ja": "莉緒。この後、ちょっといいか？", "zh": "莉绪，你等等有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1034_046rio", "source_sha256": "9d6b192ed21187a2e8940f44d102dc4373508733306bc5de25ae12898bfdb8a8", "ja": "あっ、ごめーん、{$P$}くん！\n今日はちょっと、用事があるの。……ごめんね？", "zh": "啊，对不起～{$P$}！\n今天我有点事要处理……抱歉啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1035_046rio", "source_sha256": "3ff4f56db2ddf19803932c32f9ad5a9160e549f2c12a1bcf183024bca3e3e1f5", "ja": "それじゃみんな、また明日♪\nお疲れさまー！", "zh": "那就明天见了，各位♪\n大家辛苦啰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "9bccd94b75db3f425bc49e6839bb0b0dcb9b8f4af6dd955486b4e06217677ab8", "ja": "（行ってしまった……）", "zh": "（走掉了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1037_045kar", "source_sha256": "056cab94cc39ec44417f738025d77dcabe4224d49b522828d871322feaa71dca", "ja": "あ、あの……{$P$}さん。\nちょっと、いいでしょうか……？", "zh": "那、那个……{$P$}先生，\n请问能打扰一下吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "7c04b0edbe825802e78cb7da79187424afd40e0bccdcaf07b01614d159e6290c", "ja": "可憐？　ああ、もちろん。\nどうしたんだ？", "zh": "可怜？嗯，当然可以，\n怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1039_045kar", "source_sha256": "e73aece2abd8361d9c2d3e87852cb9326a8350f8857674510f3cd2a63242c7c3", "ja": "その……り、莉緒さんについて……です。\n今日の莉緒さんは、いつもと……ちょっと違いました。", "zh": "那个……是、是关于莉绪姊……的事。\n今天的莉绪姊她……和平常不太一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "f38d5dffffe4229cf26066f370e42e4af73632d00923a2ab1d6ac1c37acb5d08", "ja": "そうか……。実は俺も気になってたんだ。\n何か悩み事があるなら、相談してほしいんだが……。", "zh": "这样啊……其实我也很在意，\n如果她有什么烦恼，希望可以提出来商量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1041_045kar", "source_sha256": "252b3ce27fdc1025efd37fd5dbb71f32506aaff189e9a6bd4de2313b72fe4749", "ja": "あ、いえ……それも、そうなんですけど……。\n違うというのは、そういうことではなく……。", "zh": "啊，不……这也没错，但……\n我说的不一样，不是这个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1042_p", "source_sha256": "4118ffb604d79b5cb5b495a0a1dbdbbc16daa80c3b70c7ac808368ad679d657e", "ja": "え？　どういうことだ？", "zh": "咦？那是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1043_045kar", "source_sha256": "6d689f2934cd8558834e0291a8bbf13032a7d2c88b8a460b756d0a274952cec7", "ja": "あの……に、匂いが……。いつもの、\n莉緒さんの香りじゃない気がして……。", "zh": "那个……味、味道……总觉得\n不是莉绪姊平常的香味……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1044_045kar", "source_sha256": "0cd4f52f05dfe48b50f91f5dda435201e97afe57708f36ff9d995383799d198e", "ja": "この前の……イベントから帰ってきたときと……\nお、同じような匂いが……。", "zh": "和之前……活动结束后回来的时候……\n有、有一样的味道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "8ed83b0a638f954eb9d76d8a932567f10472ca2193d30ef8ec61619c84e1dfe8", "ja": "この前のイベント？\nああ、黒井社長と出くわした……。", "zh": "之前的活动？\n喔喔，碰巧遇到黑井社长的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1046_p", "source_sha256": "17cad7868b9353d67d548cef35625784285262000d12acb576fc09957de00758", "ja": "って、もしかして、黒井社長の匂いか！？", "zh": "等等，该不会是黑井社长的味道吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1047_045kar", "source_sha256": "2b3e314d947777d7569b28d998260e8a999e0c84affc123afa6d55b5cf14a4fc", "ja": "そ、その人のことは、よく知らないですけど……。\nなんだか、とっても嫌な感じのする、匂いです……。", "zh": "虽、虽然我不太了解那个人……\n但总觉得，那个味道让人有很不好的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1048_p", "source_sha256": "a152e51b83a744de13437dbe3887b73ea3eaeece4342921a90c598bc7c7e6dca", "ja": "（莉緒がまた、黒井社長と会っていたってことか？\nスカウトされたとは言ってたけど……そんなはず……）", "zh": "（意思是莉绪又遇到黑井社长了吗？\n虽然她说被挖角了……但应该不会……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1049_045kar", "source_sha256": "00b2b4fcee6f11485d1f082bee5a417e53c61d0bea32701a76482ae3378b555b", "ja": "あのっ……{$P$}さん。\n私、莉緒さんのこと、わかる気がします……。", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生，\n我似乎可以理解莉绪姊的想法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1050_p", "source_sha256": "1e5a977036e296477424921545ec6d5ec8a4868be7a8b0ba5e8aff55ffe56cf9", "ja": "莉緒のこと？", "zh": "莉绪的想法？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1051_045kar", "source_sha256": "9ff4020a7ed7bb648091514ef57a0dc094bb70da7310ae670f578fad684fe720", "ja": "はい……。自信がなくて、不安で……に、逃げ出したく\nなる気持ち……。わ、私にも、たくさんあるから……。", "zh": "是的……缺乏自信又不安而……想、想要逃跑的\n心情……因、因为我也常常会这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1052_045kar", "source_sha256": "af5ac9591ecc3b52e4a3caec51a175c725de1122c1cbf6880451c46b9dca9641", "ja": "ふ……不安な気持ちに、つけこまれたら……。\n迷ってしまうことも、あると思うんです……。", "zh": "我……我想，如果在不安的时候被趁虚而入……\n应该也会感到迷惘……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1053_045kar", "source_sha256": "b197081f5a47009212eb96bc77c1edea5c027168af298f6a7659f6ba4114316e", "ja": "だから……もしも莉緒さんが、本当に移籍を迷って\nいたんだとしても……責めないであげてほしくて……。", "zh": "所以……即使莉绪姊真的在考虑跳槽……\n也希望你不要责备她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1054_p", "source_sha256": "ab758361f7a4938bf2fbe71f95a6b34d254d54a918d232134c3bb0654e59ab57", "ja": "可憐……。", "zh": "可怜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1055_045kar", "source_sha256": "0a0c2fa003281e1c2b2ff0276dc62b8da654799282c68b959e9abdc0458b471f", "ja": "な、生意気なことを言ってごめんなさい。それに、\n莉緒さんのこと、信じてないわけじゃないんです……！", "zh": "不、不好意思说了这么自以为是的话，而且，\n我也不是不相信莉绪姊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1056_045kar", "source_sha256": "b4b5b2e2aa8b345dbbadd30558bca8116fbe2e68a4fa55e5da7b8be24948c5e1", "ja": "ただ……。", "zh": "只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1057_p", "source_sha256": "42c1733521ef6f7e6f112077f0e1f593f866a514be5ab63b9dff87a9117e98f4", "ja": "可憐はえらいな。メンバーのことを思いやって、\nきちんと自分の意見を言えてる。", "zh": "可怜真了不起呢，能够为成员着想，\n并好好表达出自己的意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1058_p", "source_sha256": "3a5b778cd7a0fcad645778fb763a748231bf532e85ff0e85ddba4222fc6919ce", "ja": "何があっても、逃げずに頑張って、\nみんなをまとめようとしてくれてるんだな。", "zh": "不管发生什么事都不会逃跑，\n而且努力让大家团结呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1059_045kar", "source_sha256": "e9ca4ae95a239672821a6569bad3e67061812f4bbd5213797675f36fc8c4f5d8", "ja": "……！\nは、はいっ……！", "zh": "……！\n是、是的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1060_p", "source_sha256": "c612c5412ab2680724ed1be834b6df96e04b0442c11edae792c9e4995858b771", "ja": "ありがとう、可憐。大丈夫だ。\nあとは、俺に任せてくれ。", "zh": "可怜，谢谢你，不会有事的。\n接下来就交给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1061_p", "source_sha256": "28bbc828de6dd59736ab196175cce44c51078b75a1ecc3d9a4abe7c409a5df77", "ja": "5人そろってのARRIVEだからな。\n誰ひとり、欠けさせやしない！", "zh": "因为就是要这五个人在一起才是『ARRIVE』，\n我不会让任何人缺席的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1062_045kar", "source_sha256": "fdeec7b696cbdf0287ee565da51300fbca09cb9eb3e250c33ba96d5021bceb3e", "ja": "{$P$}さん……わ、わかりました。\n莉緒さんのこと、お願いします……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……我、我知道了。\n莉绪姊就拜托你了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_05_1063_p", "source_sha256": "155579dfc483a1226c3a03794781f402614698b7fa10e4d777c35e92ce474d41", "ja": "（黒井社長がどんな手を使ったのかは知らないが、\n莉緒はARRIVEの大事なメンバー。取り戻すぞ！）", "zh": "（虽然不知道黑井社长用了什么手段，\n但莉绪是『ARRIVE』的重要成员，我要找回她！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
